 height. Let me search for the Wikipedia page on \"The 100\" and Richard Harmon's page directly.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Richard Harmon Canadian actor The 100 Murphy\", \"The 100 CW series seven seasons 2014 2020\", \"John Murphy character The 100 Emori wife married children\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_5feab72e829e47a9bff7a09c","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d55\"},\"ref\":\"d55\",\"snippet\":\" ... The first actor to take over from Roiland in a non-Rick or Morty capacity in Jon Allen as long-running tertiary character Mr. Poopybutthole. Allen is a prolific voice actor with nearly 100 credits to his name\\n\\nFamous Guest Actors\\n\\nDana Carvey\\n\\nLeonard Smith\\n\\nThe voice of ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.denofgeek.com/tv/rick-and-morty-voice-actors-guide/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d96\"},\"ref\":\"d96\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2022)\\n\\n- May 22 Michael Sarrazin, Canadian actor (Seduction, They Shoot Horses Don't They), born in Quebec City, Quebec, Canada (d. 2011)\\n\\n- May 26 Levon Helm, American drummer and singer (The Band - \\\"Up On Cripple Creek\\\"; \\\"The Weight\\\"), and actor (Coal Miner's Daughter; The Right Stuff), born ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.onthisday.com/film-tv/birthdays/date/1940\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d123\"},\"ref\":\"d123\",\"snippet\":\" ... of the Year.\\\" As of 2011, she has been romantically linked with her Midnight in Paris (2011) co-star Michael Sheen.- Richard Harmon was born on 18 August 1991 in Mississauga, Ontario, Canada. He is an actor and producer, known for Final Destination: Bloodlines (2025), The 100 (2014 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_place=Ontario%2C%20Canada\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d124\"},\"ref\":\"d124\",\"snippet\":\" ... 1918)\\n** Patrick Barr, British actor (b. 1908)\\n** Paul Kligman, Canadian actor (b. 1923)\\n* August 30 – Taylor Caldwell, Anglo-American writer (b. 1900)\\n* August 31 – Sir Macfarlane Burnet, Australian biologist, recipient of the Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine (b. 1899)\\n\\nSeptember\\n\\n* September 1 \\n** Stefan Bellof, German racing driver ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deaths_in_1985\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d45\"},\"ref\":\"d45\",\"snippet\":\" ... Here's NCIS star Mark Harmon & wife Pam Dawber in 2011\\n\\nBEFORE THEY WERE FAMOUS: MODELS OF THE 1980s\\n\\nChild actor/model Jason Hervey\\n\\nBy the time he was known for his role as Wayne Arnold on the TV series The Wonder Years, Jason Hervey's face was ... \",\"title\":\"https://clickamericana.com/topics/celebrities-famous-people/model-to-actor-before-they-were-famous\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":3000,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":6000,\"ref\":\"e2\",\"start\":3000}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d1\"},\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... In the case of Jessica and Richard Harmon, though, the siblings actually play unrelated characters in the world of The 100.\\n\\nJessica plays Niylah, a character who shows up in the third season and has been with Clarke on a couple of different occasions. Richard played John Murph