 of longest-running American shows by broadcast type:\\n** List of longest-running American television series\\n** List of longest-running American broadcast network television series\\n** List of longest-running American cable television series\\n** List of ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_longest-running_scripted_American_primetime_television_series\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d128\"},\"ref\":\"d128\",\"snippet\":\" ... prominence in the late 2000s for creating The WB/CW fantasy drama series Supernatural (2005–2020). He served as the showrunner during the first five seasons of the series. Since then, he has created and/or produced a number of television series including Revolution (2012–2014), Timeless (2016 ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eric_Kripke\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d129\"},\"ref\":\"d129\",\"snippet\":\" ... The 100 was the defining show of 2014.\\n\\nWith its seventh and final season premiering in 2020, this teenage survivalist show brought the psychology of human nature to the forefront of American television. Touted as a dystopian sci-fi series set far in America's future, The 100 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.teenvogue.com/story/best-teen-tv-shows-2010s\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d130\"},\"ref\":\"d130\",\"snippet\":\" ... still carry the 2025 and 2026 ceremonies. | |\\n| 30 | The Los Angeles Dodgers defeat the New York Yankees to win Game 5 of the World Series. It is the 8th title in franchise's history and second since the shortened 2020 season. The Dodgers have become the first team ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_in_American_television\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d131\"},\"ref\":\"d131\",\"snippet\":\" ... series, and series canceled after the 2020–21 television season.\\n\\nNBC was the first to announce its fall schedule on May 14, 2021, followed by Fox on May 17, ABC on May 18, CBS on May 19, and The CW on May 25, 2021.\\n\\nEffective this season, The ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2021%E2%80%9322_United_States_network_television_schedule\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d132\"},\"ref\":\"d132\",\"snippet\":\" ... Discovery—The broadcast television run was meant for one season only; it concluded on February 4, 2021.\\n* The Unicorn—Canceled on May 15, 2021, after two seasons.\\n\\nThe CW\\n\\n* Black Lightning—It was announced on November 20, 2020, that season four would be the final season. The series ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020%E2%80%9321_United_States_network_television_schedule\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d133\"},\"ref\":\"d133\",\"snippet\":\" ... The CW has decreased its percentage dramatically from 14.8 percent in the 2022-2023 season to 6.3 percent in the 2023-2024 season. This is the first time in seven years that The CW did not have the highest percentage of LGBTQ series regulars on broadcast ... \",\"title\":\"https://glaad.org/whereweareontv23/summary-of-broadcast-findings/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d134\"},\"ref\":\"d134\",\"snippet\":\" ... season, striking out Manny Machado for the final out of the World Series...Prior to Sale, the